import{_ as a,o as n,c as t,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 453 | Dragon Ball · Realm-System Alternative: The Stable Framework of Nine Realms Plus Two","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 453 | Dragon Ball · Realm-System Alternative: The Stable Framework of Nine Realms Plus Two","no":453,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Realm System","Nine Realms","Multiverse","Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse","Law-First"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance","10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0453_模块2-龙珠-境界体系替代-九境加二境的稳定框架.md","filePath":"en/0453_模块2-龙珠-境界体系替代-九境加二境的稳定框架.md"}'),o={name:"en/0453_模块2-龙珠-境界体系替代-九境加二境的稳定框架.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,m){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-453-dragon-ball-·-realm-system-alternative-the-stable-framework-of-nine-realms-plus-two" tabindex="-1">Entry 453 | Dragon Ball · Realm-System Alternative: The Stable Framework of Nine Realms Plus Two <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-453-dragon-ball-·-realm-system-alternative-the-stable-framework-of-nine-realms-plus-two" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 453 | Dragon Ball · Realm-System Alternative: The Stable Framework of Nine Realms Plus Two&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 22 · Alternative 2) | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 27, 10</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-put-a-ceiling-on-transformation-layers" tabindex="-1">Introduction: put a ceiling on transformation layers <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-put-a-ceiling-on-transformation-layers" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: put a ceiling on transformation layers&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball&#39;s realm collapse is essentially &quot;transformation layers uncapped&quot;: SSJ1/2/3/God/Blue/Ultra Instinct/Selfishness; each layer is &quot;can&#39;t win then add another layer.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is the stable framework of nine realms plus two: Sense/Condensed/Transform/Law/Dao Origin, Dao Integration, Boundary-Breaking, World-Creation, Origin nine realms, plus extended Multiverse and Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse (alias &quot;Hyper-Multiverse Balanced Anchor realm&quot;); each realm has clear promotion laws, triple exam conditions, Alaya supervision. This entry takes the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> as core, comparing Dragon Ball transformation layers with Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-realm framework.</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores, with the law-first axiom as core. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball transformation layers&#39; energy waste core is &quot;old forms devalued&quot;: every new transformation layer appears, old form becomes base state. Heng Yuan Zhou nine-realm framework&#39;s anti-waste design: <strong>every realm is a civilization-contribution position, not &quot;the previous realm&#39;s discard.&quot;</strong> A Sense-Origin cultivator can be a basic-method promoter; a Condensed-Origin can be a community mentor; any stage cultivator has a civilization-contribution position; no &quot;devaluation.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball transformation layers make cultivators lose direction — since transformation is the only path, why practice anything else? Heng Yuan Zhou nine-realm framework&#39;s anti-regression design: <strong>300 Origin cultivation systems, six categories × 50 each, parallel; any cultivator can find a path suited to them</strong> — deduction iteration, life cycle, spatial-law scheduling directions parallel; does not force all cultivators to walk the single road of &quot;combat.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball transformation layers&#39; predatory nature: <strong>transformation layers&#39; defining right and strongest layer both tied to Goku.</strong> Heng Yuan Zhou nine-realm framework&#39;s anti-predation design: <strong>any cultivator meeting triple conditions (cultivation duration + mind-cultivation exam + contribution points) can advance; not by bloodline, not by emotion, not by &quot;being chosen by a god.&quot;</strong> Vegeta no longer chases Goku for decades; Gohan no longer pulled back to the battlefield; every cultivator has their own promotion track.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dragon Ball Transformation Layers</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Nine-Plus-Two Realms Framework</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SSJ1/2/3/God/Blue/Ultra Instinct/Selfishness</td><td>Sense/Condensed/Transform/Law/Dao Origin, Dao Integration, Boundary-Breaking, World-Creation, Origin</td></tr><tr><td>Transformation layers added with plot</td><td>New dimensions (Multiverse, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse) via appendix increment; do not overturn old setting</td></tr><tr><td>Emotion = breakthrough key</td><td>Nine-realm promotion triple conditions: cultivation duration + mind-cultivation exam + contribution points</td></tr><tr><td>Bloodline = transformation qualification</td><td>Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage; any race meeting conditions can advance</td></tr><tr><td>Old forms devalued</td><td>Every realm is a civilization-contribution position; no &quot;devaluation&quot;</td></tr><tr><td>Combat-power inflation</td><td>Anchor calibration (Doc 027) periodically calibrates energy definitions</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Dragon Ball world; map transformation layers to the nine-realm framework</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;Goku = Origin realm, Vegeta = Origin realm, Gohan = Dao-Integration realm&quot; control</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count &quot;companion no-longer-devaluation rate,&quot; &quot;Myriad-Ranks cultivator exit rate,&quot; &quot;combat-power inflation rate&quot;</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Nine-Realm Framework Replacing Dragon Ball Transformation-Layers Benefit Report</em>, quantifying &quot;using nine realms to replace transformation layers, how much Dragon Ball world&#39;s self-consistency can rise&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Dragon Ball transformation-layers self-consistency: extremely low (2/10)</strong></li><li><strong>Nine-realm framework self-consistency: 9.5/10</strong> (law precedes, triple conditions, appendix increment)</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: Dragon Ball = high; nine-realm framework = low (network)</li><li><strong>Expansion guarantee</strong>: Multiverse, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse as extended dimensions, via appendix access; never overturn old setting</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: every realm is a civilization-contribution position; old forms not devalued</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: promotion not by bloodline, not by emotion, but by triple conditions</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s ferocious realm has a cap; Dragon Ball transformations uncapped; nine-realm framework both open and law-bound</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: any race, any cultivator has a promotion track</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Nine realms + Multiverse + Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse; can infinitely expand without collapse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball&#39;s transformation culture is hot-blooded, but its structure is collapsing. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-plus-two-realm framework proves one thing: long-running combat IP does not need to continue by &quot;adding another transformation layer&quot; — as long as law precedes, promotion via triple conditions, expansion via appendix increment, the realm system can infinitely expand without losing control. Dragon Ball&#39;s lesson is the common alarm bell for all combat IPs.</p><p>One more layer of practical mapping: if Dragon Ball characters are reclassified by the nine-realm framework, Goku and Vegeta should correspond to &quot;Origin realm&quot; (cosmos-tier strong-one threshold), Gohan and Piccolo to &quot;Dao-Integration realm,&quot; Krillin and Tien Shinhan to &quot;Law-Origin realm&quot; — this mapping is far clearer than &quot;SSJ1/2/3&quot; vague descriptions. Readers can from then on judge: Krillin is Law-Origin realm; he cannot beat Origin-realm Frieza, because between nine realms there is a clear law abyss. This is &quot;law precedes&quot;&#39;s practical value: it makes battle results predictable, not &quot;who plot needs who wins.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · realm-system alternative · the stable framework of nine realms plus two described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./452_模块2-龙珠-锚点共生替代方案-战力体系的文明化改造.html">Entry 452 · Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</a> · <a href="./458_模块2-龙珠-法则优先对照-衡元宙如何避免战力膨胀.html">Entry 458 · Law-First Comparison</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const g=a(o,[["render",r]]);export{h as __pageData,g as default};
